-- Complete opening inventory of owned completion declarations.
-- Tower universal properties and ring maps open their named source/target
-- carriers, scalar laws and finite expression constructors. The exchange
-- boundary identifies two presentations of four polynomial extensions;
-- those comparisons also open PolynomialRing/Quotient operation aliases.
-- Ring section formulas open finite power/sum recursors and their arguments.
-- Witness maps open explicit tree constructors and module actions; chart
-- assembly opens finite supports, singleton values and matrix coefficient
-- actions. Extraction uses the same support/degree definitions as ZMT4Extract.
-- Final exports open only the named construction interfaces and natural
-- number conversions. These lists were compared against the informal proofs.
